Package: omniroute
Version: 3.8.52
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: npm, python, build-essential, git, ca-certificates
Section: ai
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.omniroute.online/
Description: AI gateway with one OpenAI-compatible endpoint for many providers
 OmniRoute is a local AI gateway that routes requests across many AI
 providers through a single OpenAI-compatible endpoint, with automatic
 fallback and a web dashboard. This package installs the npm release for
 normal Termux Node.js and provides the omniroute command.
